                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Pringle to Mr.
                            Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-06-25"><hi rendition="#italic">June 25,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Minister for foreign affairs of Honduras telegraphs three arrests made in the
                    Renton case.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Pringle.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
